ny sort of special skills, he is a very warm and friendly person. The only skill he thought he had was luck."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He seems to have forgotten who Kazuki is really. While he was young, he contracted the same virus that Hiroya Yoshizumi is infected with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20402"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7ffff8be2e2aac5d68f398bb77c740d27bbf0b59a10a3615220cbe6038065a96.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/7562a414527ef2da389ace824fe0e183aaf84981c0728bf23bdd2f0cf252c48d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福山 潤","creatorId":"vndb:s393","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s393","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s393","name":"福山潤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8210","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20403","characterName":"遠藤 和希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20403"},"originalCharacterName":"遠藤 和希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"609"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is Keita's classmate and the first friend Keita makes at BL Academy. Endō is also a part of the school's handicrafts club."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He leads a double life as a student of BL Academy and as its chairman. The last wishes of the school's late chairman, Endō's grandfather, were for Endō to succeed his position. Endō's innocuous and perpetually friendly demeanor does not betray the fact that he is also an excellent executive. He is actually Keita's childhood friend who promised in the future that they could go to the same school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20403"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f13667507bb02f466b14643798d8aebacc34789b07151debf24acdaf6645644.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6ca4b2cda10c4d55a9fee997c2c980ac9ca62a4235113beac833d24a8d210b53.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8201","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20404","characterName":"西園寺 郁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20404"},"originalCharacterName":"西園寺 郁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"214"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the head of the school Treasury/Accounting department. Strikingly beautiful, he shares the same amount of influence as Tetsuya Niwa, and is called the \"Queen\" among students. He is very strong intellectually but performs very poorly in physical education. Even though he is called the \"Queen,\" he hates it when someone treats him like a female."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is close to Omi since Elementary days, going as far as making him hack into the BL academy server when Omi didn't receive the platinum paper. He also has close contact with the chairman and contacts him if something sprouts up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20404"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d15c4c53d25fed25878b32c5d779b23359710ffe52299ce684a4553ad21f8d57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6dbde656a9d8fabb42b4198ce01ef32cad4722e108a353a5f00e3045965d1bca.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神谷 浩史","creatorId":"vndb:s132","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s132","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s132","name":"神谷 浩史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8205","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20405","characterName":"丹羽 哲也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20405"},"originalCharacterName":"丹羽 哲也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"815"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"187"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the president of the student council, he excels in almost everything, from academics to sports and extracurriculars; he is also known as the \"King\" at the academy. He regularly neglects his duties leaving them to the very last minute. He also has a tendency to call Kaoru, \"Kaoru-chan,\" which results in the latter hurting him. He has an aversion to cats."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20405"}],"profileFacts":